* Component corners for the trace-sample front end, as .lib sections (ams.corners model_corners, lib.section).
* Each scales the parts that set the gain and the filter by their tolerance (R 1 %, C1 X7R 10 %):
*   tt  nominal
*   ff  fast corner: the filter's corner frequency highest (R3 and C1 low) and the divider's gain highest
*       (R1 low, R2 high)
*   ss  slow corner: the filter slowest and the gain lowest
.lib tt
.param k_r1=1 k_r2=1 k_r3=1 k_c1=1
.endl tt
.lib ff
.param k_r1=0.99 k_r2=1.01 k_r3=0.99 k_c1=0.9
.endl ff
.lib ss
.param k_r1=1.01 k_r2=0.99 k_r3=1.01 k_c1=1.1
.endl ss
